# Rust
target/
**/*.rs.bk

# CMake / Qt
build/
/shell/build
# A second build tree, Release, for the perf gate — the numbers are wrong out
# of a Debug one. See bench/README.md.
/shell/build-release
# A third, for the Windows cross build. See shell/README.md.
/shell/build-win
# A fourth, built in the *Ubuntu* container against its Qt 6.4.2 — which is
# what CI has. The sanctioned container is sterna-fedora and its 6.11.1, so a
# painting assertion can pass there and fail in CI; this is where to reproduce
# that. It is not for measuring anything. See AGENTS.md.
/shell/build-ubuntu
*.o
*.so
*.a
compile_commands.json

# Oracle spike artifacts
/oracle/build
/oracle/out

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Context about the user and this machine, for whichever agent is working here.
# Deliberately not tracked: the repository is public and this is not about the
# code. `AGENTS.md` tells an agent to read it if it is there.
/AGENTS.local.md
